6. Chair UI spec (docs/ui-spec.md)

Views

- Main Arena view
  - Panels:
    - Roster: list of debaters, status (connected, speaking, idle).
    - Controls:  
      - Buttons: Start, Pause, Resume, End.  
      - Turn: Next speaker, Interrupt, Redirect (dropdown).  
      - Flavour: Trigger Confucius, toggle Ent Mode.
    - Transcript: scrolling log with:
      - Speaker name
      - Timestamp
      - Text (streamed)
      - Event markers (interrupts, Confucius, state changes).

UX details

- Streaming:  
  - Use WebSocket to receive transcript events; append lines as they arrive.
- Interrupt:  
  - On click, send INTERRUPT → Arena sends STOP to current node.
- Redirect:  
  - After interrupt, choose new speaker from dropdown → Arena sends SPEAK to that node with updated context.
- Ent Mode toggle:  
  - Global flag; Arena includes ent_mode: true in SPEAK payload; nodes slow down token emission.

